  "title": "Plug Power Customers Surpass 10 Million GenFuel Hydrogen Fills",
  "summary": "On January 5, 2018, Plug Power customers surpassed the 10 millionth hydrogen fill using a GenFuel dispenser to refuel a GenDrive-powered forklift. That’s an average of 15,000 fills each day over the last year, which has bumped our count total from 5 million to 10 million in just eleven months. What does this mean to […]",
